#: 55e173dfc3154259840d918de055fc6d
msgid "RC input is configured by default via the USART6 RX input. It supports all serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:61
#: 7b37aecb3eba495c9b1256bc5163e5cf
msgid "Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART6 TX pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX6 and TX6 and set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` also to 3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:64
#: 095f1c8acf8f4fd991496aed6a263aab
msgid "If SBUS is used on HD VTX connector (DJI TX), then :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOl<SERIAL1_PROTOCOl>` should be set to \"23\" and :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` changed to something else."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:67
#: 19522e768e1b45a7aa6597f5f778bdd1
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:68
#: 0c0e9d4b8fa1472e95ad3525e671253a
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the T1 pin (UART1 transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT:"
